WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,370
Oh mother, what can he do to me? He just said a few words and it’s not right.

2
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:10,720
Are you satisfied with Mr. Xu's appearance?

3
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:16,450
How could you just look at his appearance and not ask about his family status?

4
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:23,600
If Chunwei is too serious next year, mother, Chunwei might not be able to pass the exam.

5
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:29,950
He has a little problem with his legs and feet

6
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,310
what is a skirt

7
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:38,340
I'm going to settle the score with Mrs. Wang. If you dare to fool me with a skirt, please calm down.

8
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:41,540
Even if there is a problem with pushing the feet, the merit will be ten to ten.

9
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:44,340
Just think about it, people can be exempted from rumors and have tax deductions.

10
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:47,140
As a merchant, how much do we have to pay every year just in taxes?

11
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:50,660
We are making a lot of money this time. Does our family lack the money to pay taxes?

12
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,260
This damn girl has been looking after her face since she was a child.

13
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:56,660
His brother was ugly when he was a child and he didn't want to retaliate

14
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,020
What do you mean, fame pays taxes?

15
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:00,580
In the final analysis, I just took a fancy to Mr. Xu’s appearance.

16
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:06,020
Since my mother doesn’t agree, then I won’t marry you and you can support me for the rest of my life.

17
00:01:06,020 --> 00:01:10,020
What nonsense are you talking about? Can you stand the salty smoked fish outside?

18
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:14,480
Besides, he’s a skirt guy and he can’t beat me, and I won’t be bullied, right?

19
00:01:28,110 --> 00:01:31,920
Are you a girl from the Song family? Who are you?

20
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:37,280
This is what the young master just ordered the young one to go pick and buy from eight treasures and give it to Miss Song to try.

21
00:01:50,340 --> 00:01:53,540
Although the Xu family is poor, this boy can still be kind to others.

22
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:57,700
Zhou Moumou went to buy two roast ducks from Sanqingfang and gave them to the Xu family

23
00:01:58,530 --> 00:02:00,690
Our Song family will not take advantage of him.
